Package: polo-tweaks
Architecture: any
Depends: polo,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: settings program for the Polo Wayland compositor
 Polo Tweaks edits every key of Polo's four GSettings schemas
 (general, wobbly windows, animations, expo, cube and shortcuts pages).
 Polo's GSettings schemas must be installed, which the polo package provides.
